@endpoint = http://localhost:3000/api/v1/people


### get all people
GET {{endpoint}} HTTP/3.0
content-type: application/json

### Create Person
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/people
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "Person",
  "frequencyDays": 7,
  "lastContacted": null,
  "openers": ["How are you?"]
}

### create new person
POST {{{endpoint}}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Smith",
  "frequencyDays": 7,
  "lastContacted": null,
  "openers": ["How are you?"]
}

### get test person by id
GET {{endpoint}}/6acbe8f7025f8f1274748d23 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json